  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Familiar candy packaging appears transformed into archetypal forms of commerce in this series of digital photographs, arranged across a displayable accordion fold. All elements of language and symbols have been stripped from Reeses Cups and Snickers Bars through Photoshop alterations. The images are simultaneously strange and familiar, allowing the viewer to oscillate between branding specificity and geometric conformity.  Printed Matter.</subfield>
